<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Estrategia 2026 Kaspersky & GMS</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Estrategia 2026 Kaspersky & GMS - Habilitamos un mundo digital más seguro.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#222222" font-size="14px" line-height="1.5" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      .badge-new {
        background-color: #00A88E;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: bold;
        padding: 2px 6px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        display: inline-block;
        margin-left: 4px;
      }
      .card-box {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e4e9ee;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .module-box {
        background-color: #f3f8ff;
        border-left: 5px solid #005CFF;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 20px;
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f3f5f7">

    <!-- Pre-header / Web version link -->
    <mj-section padding="12px 20px" background-color="#f3f5f7">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="right" font-size="12px" color="#606970">
          ¿No ves correctamente este correo? <a href="#" style="color: #005CFF; text-decoration: underline;">Ver en el navegador</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Main Wrapper Card -->
    <mj-wrapper padding="0" background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0px">

      <!-- Header Logos & Tag -->
      <mj-section background-color="#062351" padding="28px 25px 24px 25px">
        <mj-column width="60%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text align="left" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="20px" font-weight="bold" padding="0">
            <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
              <tr>
                <td style="vertical-align: middle;">
                  <img src="https://mariomegu-learn.github.io/Pre-Sales/Campaigns/assets/LOGO_BLANCO.png" alt="GMS" height="30" style="display: block; height: 30px; width: auto;" />
                </td>
                <td style="vertical-align: middle; padding: 0 15px; font-size: 20px; color: #5FFFE5;">|</td>
                <td style="vertical-align: middle;">
                  <img src="https://mariomegu-learn.github.io/Pre-Sales/Campaigns/assets/Kaspersky_logotype_white.png" alt="Kaspersky" height="30" style="display: block; height: 30px; width: auto;" />
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="40%" vertical-align="middle">
          <mj-text align="right" color="#5FFFE5" font-size="12px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="1.2px" padding="0">
            ESTRATEGIA 2026
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Accent Divider Line -->
      <mj-section background-color="#005CFF" padding="0px" style="height: 4px;">
        <mj-column width="100%" padding="0">
          <mj-text padding="0" font-size="1px" line-height="1px">&nbsp;</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <mj-section background-color="#062351" padding="45px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#5FFFE5" font-size="14px" font-weight="bold" text-transform="uppercase" letter-spacing="1.2px" padding-bottom="15px">
            Estrategia 2026 Kaspersky &amp; GMS
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#FFFFFF" font-size="36px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="20px">
            Habilitamos un mundo digital más seguro.
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#dbe6f4" font-size="17px" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="25px">
            <strong>Equipo:</strong> Con el objetivo de seguir consolidando nuestro conocimiento en la marca, les presento el ecosistema de soluciones de Kaspersky y cómo estas se integran de manera clave en nuestra visión estratégica.
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#5FFFE5" font-size="15px" font-weight="bold" padding-bottom="10px">
            Les comparto la presentación completa:
          </mj-text>
          <mj-button background-color="#00A88E" color="#ffffff" font-size="15px" font-weight="bold" border-radius="7px" align="left" padding-top="10px" href="#">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/powerpoint.png" alt="PPTX Icon" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Descargar Estrategia Kaspersky - GMS - 2026.pptx
          </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- SECCIÓN PRINCIPAL: Verticales Tier 1 -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="40px 30px 15px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#005CFF" font-size="13px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="1px" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="8px">
            Seguridad empresarial
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#062351" font-size="28px" font-weight="bold" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="12px">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/shield.png" alt="Shield" width="26" height="26" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Verticales Tier 1
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#606970" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="15px">
            Portafolio principal estructurado para brindar seguridad integral a través de seis pilares fundamentales de protección tecnológica.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Tier 1: Row 1 (Cards 1 & 2) -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0px 20px 15px 20px">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/computer.png" alt="Endpoint" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Endpoint
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>Kaspersky Next EDR / XDR Optimum &amp; Expert</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Hybrid Cloud Security</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Mobile</li>
                <li>Embedded Systems Security for Windows</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/eye.png" alt="Visibilidad" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Visibilidad
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>KUMA (Unified Monitoring &amp; Analysis)</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Next XDR Core &amp; Expert</li>
                <li>Anti Targeted Attack Platform</li>
                <li>Industrial CyberSecurity for Networks</li>
                <li>Threat Intelligence Portal</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Tier 1: Row 2 (Cards 3 & 4) -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0px 20px 15px 20px">
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/shield.png" alt="Perimetral" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Seguridad Perimetral
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>Anti Targeted Attack Platform</li>
                <li>Security for Mail Server / Internet Gateway</li>
                <li>Web Traffic Security</li>
                <li>DDoS Protection</li>
                <li>Data Feeds para integración con NGFW</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/database.png" alt="Apps y Datos" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Aplicaciones y Datos
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>Kaspersky Scan Engine</li>
                <li>Security for Microsoft Office 365</li>
                <li>Security for Storage</li>
                <li>Container Security</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Tier 1: Row 3 (Cards 5 & 6) -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0px 20px 25px 20px">
        <!-- Card 5 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/siren.png" alt="SOC" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> SOC
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>KUMA / MDR</li>
                <li>Threat Intelligence Portal &amp; Data Feeds</li>
                <li>Anti Targeted Attack Platform</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Next XDR Expert</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Sandbox</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <!-- Card 6 -->
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="10px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="card-box">
              <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/cloud.png" alt="Nube" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Seguridad en Nube
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #606970; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                <li>Cloud Workload Security</li>
                <li>Hybrid Cloud Security</li>
                <li>Container Security</li>
                <li>Security for Microsoft Office 365</li>
                <li>Security Center Cloud Console</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Divider -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="solid" border-color="#e4e9ee" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- SECCIÓN SECUNDARIA: Verticales Tier 2 -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="35px 30px 15px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#005CFF" font-size="13px" font-weight="bold" letter-spacing="1px" text-transform="uppercase" padding-bottom="8px">
            Estrategia Complementaria
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#062351" font-size="28px" font-weight="bold" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="12px">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/flash-auto.png" alt="Tier 2" width="26" height="26" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" /> Verticales Tier 2
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#606970" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="15px">
            Complementamos la estrategia principal gestionando riesgos proactivamente, asegurando el desarrollo y protegiendo las identidades corporativas.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Tier 2 Modules -->
      <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0px 20px 35px 20px">
        <!-- Module A -->
        <mj-column width="33.33%" padding="8px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="module-box">
              <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/scales.png" alt="Riesgo" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 4px;" /> Gestión del Riesgo
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; color: #606970; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                <li>Vulnerability Assessment &amp; Patch Management</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Vulnerability Data Feed</li>
                <li>Industrial CyberSecurity for Networks (OT risk assessment)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>

        <!-- Module B -->
        <mj-column width="33.33%" padding="8px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="module-box">
              <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/source-code.png" alt="Código" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 4px;" /> Análisis de Código
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; color: #606970; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                <li>Kaspersky Application Security Assessment</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>

        <!-- Module C -->
        <mj-column width="33.33%" padding="8px">
          <mj-text padding="0">
            <div class="module-box">
              <div style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: #062351; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/fingerprint.png" alt="Identidades" width="18" height="18" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 4px;" /> Identidades
              </div>
              <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 15px; color: #606970; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5;">
                <li>Digital Footprint Intelligence (Contraseñas Expuestas)</li>
                <li>Brand Monitoring</li>
                <li>Kaspersky Password Manager Business <span class="badge-new">Nuevo en Q4 2026</span></li>
                <li>Kaspersky Next XDR Optimum (Respuesta sobre AD)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Footer Section / Gracias -->
      <mj-section background-color="#062351" padding="40px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text align="center" color="#5FFFE5" font-size="28px" font-weight="bold" padding-bottom="12px">
            ¡GRACIAS!
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text align="center" color="#dbe6f4" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="24px">
            Quedo a su disposición para resolver dudas técnicas, acompañarlos en sus oportunidades comerciales o profundizar en cualquiera de las soluciones. ¡Hablemos!
          </mj-text>
          <mj-button background-color="#005CFF" color="#ffffff" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" border-radius="7px" align="center" href="https://wa.me/">
            <img src="https://img.icons8.com/color/48/whatsapp.png" alt="WhatsApp" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 6px;" /> Más información &rarr;
          </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Sub-Footer -->
      <mj-section background-color="#222222" padding="35px 30px">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text align="center" font-size="13px" line-height="22px" color="#b9c1c8">
            © 2026 GMS Seguridad. Todos los derechos reservados.<br />
            Bogotá • Quito • Lima
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

    </mj-wrapper>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
